# THis is the file which we will use for the homework.
Where after running the script code ./script.sh myfile.txt the current file is
renamed to the new name myfile.txt+today date.

For example: Let us consider the file name is my_file.txt and when we run the script then our new name of the file will be-

my_file.txt20260222 : As bcz today date is 22 Februry 2026.
